      "Apply only after xdm_android_browser_removal_phase8c_queue_intelligence_execution_policy_overlay.zip.",
      "Adds a pure resolver workspace for probe status, format comparison, estimated size, audio/subtitle metadata, protected-media diagnostics, and recent resolution history derived from media captures.",
